# Run ./wiremock/run.sh first. WebSocket requests require the JetBrains HTTP Client.
@host = 127.0.0.1:8080

### Hello world JSON
GET http://{{host}}/hello
Accept: application/json

> {%
    client.test("Hello world JSON", function () {
        client.assert(response.status === 200, "Expected HTTP 200");
        client.assert(response.body.message === "Hello, world!", "Unexpected JSON response");
    });
%}

### WebSocket: send the text message ping; receive the text message pong
WEBSOCKET ws://{{host}}/ws/ping-pong

ping

### Inspect the loaded WebSocket message stub
GET http://{{host}}/__admin/message-mappings

### Inspect received/sent WebSocket messages after running ping/pong
GET http://{{host}}/__admin/messages
